## Audit trail
- Sign-in / sign-out / registration are now `AUTH_LOGIN`, `AUTH_LOGOUT`, `ACCOUNT_REGISTERED` (were `PREFERENCES_UPDATED`).
  Old rows are displayed with the correct action without rewriting them (that would break their fingerprints).
